Z||000021||DreXteR||08-22-2001||08:52 PM||||00|E - HEheeh, thats is all I want to hear  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Im making some progress in the research for value-performance parts. As soon I confirmed and proved the "stuff" the forum will be notified.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>jimmybpei - There is a roller cam that fits, and GM make it. BUT you cant use the roller lifters if the block doesnt support it. Otherwise will be expensive the mod, better shoot is get a new block that support it.  BTW, I beleave the roller cam can be used with the normal hidraulic lifters.<P>DreX||196.32.141.176||reg||1
